## Impure logic it catches

```javascript
// BAD — new array every render, breaks memoization downstream
function List() {
  const items = generateItems(); // impure / unstable reference
  return items.map((i) => <Row key={i.id} data={i} />);
}

// GOOD — stable state or memoized value
const [items, setItems] = useState(() => generateItems());
```

